# Fixed defect 2432, 2026-11-10, lane b30-pkg, a shape beside it: the
# package `json`'s own catalogue names an entry `let`, a word of another
# language Heroes refuses, which no `use` of `json`'s can write.
#
# The package's own catalogue is read by the same reader as the program's,
# so it refuses that entry at its line, and the package is told unread on
# the `use` that reaches it (panel 235's R3).
use <json>/p  #~ package_unread

function main()
    print(p.n())
